 "text": "# Visão geral\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Formulários\nHuman version (rendered examples): formularios/visao-geral.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\nTodos os controles de formulário do Bootstrap com o visual de campo do jogo: fundo cinza-claro, borda fina, rótulos azuis.\n\n## Exemplo\n\n```\n<form style=\"max-width:420px\">\n  <div class=\"mb-2\">\n    <label for=\"vg-email\" class=\"form-label\">E-mail</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"vg-email\" placeholder=\"nome@exemplo.com\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-2\">\n    <label for=\"vg-sel\" class=\"form-label\">Classe</label>\n    <select id=\"vg-sel\" class=\"form-select\">\n      <option>Espadachim</option>\n      <option>Mago</option>\n      <option>Gatuno</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-2\">\n    <label for=\"vg-msg\" class=\"form-label\">Mensagem</label>\n    <textarea class=\"form-control\" id=\"vg-msg\" rows=\"2\"></textarea>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"form-check mb-2\">\n    <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"vg-ck\" checked>\n    <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"vg-ck\">Lembrar de mim</label>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Enviar</button>\n</form>\n```\n\n## Dois jeitos de escrever\n\n- Bootstrap: form-control, form-select, form-check-input...\n- Nativo do kit: cro-input, cro-select, cro-textarea, cro-check, cro-field, cro-label. Veja Formulários cro-*.\n- Elementos nus: sem classe nenhuma, o <input> já sai estilizado (Reboot).\n\n## Tipos de input\n\n```\n<div class=\"row g-2\">\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-text\">Texto</label>\n    <input id=\"t-text\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"valor\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-pw\">Senha</label>\n    <input id=\"t-pw\" type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"segredo\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-num\">Número</label>\n    <input id=\"t-num\" type=\"number\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"42\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-date\">Data</label>\n    <input id=\"t-date\" type=\"date\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"2026-10-08\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-time\">Hora</label>\n    <input id=\"t-time\" type=\"time\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"12:30\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-file\">Arquivo</label>\n    <input id=\"t-file\" type=\"file\" class=\"form-control\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-color\">Cor</label>\n    <input id=\"t-color\" type=\"color\" class=\"form-control form-control-color\" value=\"#3366cc\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-ro\">Somente leitura</label>\n    <input id=\"t-ro\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"readonly\" readonly>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"t-dis\">Desabilitado</label>\n    <input id=\"t-dis\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"disabled\" disabled>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\nLimitation\n\nOs popups nativos de data, hora e cor continuam do navegador; o CSS só estiliza o campo.\n\n## Texto de ajuda e extras\n\n```\n<div style=\"max-width:360px\">\n  <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"vg-s\">Senha</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"vg-s\" type=\"password\" aria-describedby=\"vg-help\">\n  <div id=\"vg-help\" class=\"form-text\">form-text: mínimo de 8 caracteres.</div>\n  <div class=\"form-check form-check-reverse mt-2\">\n    <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"vg-rev\">\n    <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"vg-rev\">form-check-reverse</label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n« Ícones · Form control »\n",
